{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109441","id":2731640573,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i0Yb9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109441","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109441.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109441.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109441","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109441/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109441/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109441/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f0eddb8e6f46b51435743d02bd64b4c805635c0e","number":109441,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix issues searching `RichTextLabel` when search result is in a table","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes for cases where search results would be skipped or repeatedly found involving tables in `RichTextLabel`:\r\n- If previous result was found in last cell of table, earlier cells would be skipped, since the end of the table was reached.  Updated to not skip earlier cells when searching in reverse.\r\n- When choosing next line to continue from after searching table, the inner line number within the table's cell was added, causing the search to jump forward if not on line 0 in the cell.  This could cause lines to get skipped when searching forward, or searching the table again when searching in reverse.  Updated to continue from the immediate next line before/after the table.\r\n- If a table cell has multiple lines, repeated searching would only include the line where the previous result was found, then jump to the next cell.  Updated to search remaining lines in the same cell first.\r\n\r\nFixes #103817\r\n\r\nExamples of each case below:\r\n\r\nCase 1: MRP from #103817.  Can also be reproduced with many class's constructors in the in-editor help.  One example is `AABB`: in the `AABB` documentation, search for \"AABB\" until you reach the last constructor `AABB AABB(position: Vector3, size: Vector3)`.  When the last AABB is selected, searching previous would jump past the rest of the constructors section.\r\n\r\nCase 2: This was the example given in one of the comments in the linked issue.  When searching backward for \"bbcode\" in the `RichTextLabel` in-editor documentation, the search would get stuck on the \"bbcode\" result in a codeblock.  Searching for \"ready\" in the same page would give the same result for codeblocks where \"ready\" is not on the first line, but would continue searching past the codeblock where \"ready\" is on the first line.\r\n\r\nCase 3: Searching for \"install_effect\" in the `RichTextLabel` in-editor documentation.  There are two results on different lines in the same code block.  Searching forward would skip over the second result (backward would get stuck due to case 1).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sau